<!-- ARCHIVE VIEW -->
<section class="archive-section" id="archive">
  <div class="archive-intro">
    <div>
      <h2><span class="en-only">Archive</span><span class="ar-only ar" dir="rtl">الأرشيف</span></h2>
    </div>
    <p class="en-only">A record of what has happened in the Cabinet — opening nights, choirs, workshops, the slow rebuild of a 1986 bus into a cinema. Each entry is a short note from us, written soon after the event.</p>
    <p class="ar-only ar" dir="rtl">سِجلٌّ لما حدث في المجلس — ليالي افتتاح، جوقات، ورش، وإعادة بناء بطيئة لحافلة من ١٩٨٦ لتصبح سينما. كل مدخلة هي ملاحظة قصيرة منّا، مكتوبة بعد الحدث.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="archive-list" id="archive-list">
    <a class="archive-entry" href="event.html?id=archive-printclub-jul-2025">
      <div class="ae-cover"><img src="assets/covers/print.svg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div>
        <div class="archive-meta-row">
          <span class="type">Workshop</span>
          <span>05 July 2025</span>
          <span>Studio</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="ae-title">Risograph Print Club</h3>
        <div class="ae-title-ar ar" dir="rtl">نادي الريزوغراف</div>
        <p class="ae-writeup en-only">Twelve people walked out with their first risograph prints — fluorescent pink and blue, ink still drying. The two-colour palette became the constraint that shaped half a dozen unexpected collaborations.</p>
        <p class="ae-writeup-ar ar-only ar" dir="rtl">اثنا عشر شخصاً غادروا الستوديو حاملين أوّل أعمالهم بالريزوغراف، بحبر زهري فلوري وأزرق.</p>
        <span class="ae-readmore">
          <span class="en-only">Read full account</span>
          <span class="ar-only ar" dir="rtl">القراءة كاملةً</span>
          <span class="ae-readmore-arrow">→</span>
        </span>
      </div>
    </a>
  
    <a class="archive-entry" href="event.html?id=archive-sumud-may-2025">
      <div class="ae-cover"><img src="assets/covers/sumud.svg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div>
        <div class="archive-meta-row">
          <span class="type">Performance</span>
          <span>10 May 2025</span>
          <span>Main hall</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="ae-title">Sumud — A Choir for the Land</h3>
        <div class="ae-title-ar ar" dir="rtl">صمود — جوقة للأرض</div>
        <p class="ae-writeup en-only">A choir of twenty-four voices, drawn from villages across Palestine, performed an evening of work songs, lullabies and lament. Recordings of the night were broadcast a week later on Radio AlHara.</p>
        <p class="ae-writeup-ar ar-only ar" dir="rtl">جوقة من أربعة وعشرين صوتاً، من قرى متعددة في فلسطين، أدّت أمسية من أغاني العمل والتهليلات والرثاء.</p>
        <span class="ae-readmore">
          <span class="en-only">Read full account</span>
          <span class="ar-only ar" dir="rtl">القراءة كاملةً</span>
          <span class="ae-readmore-arrow">→</span>
        </span>
      </div>
    </a>
  
    <a class="archive-entry" href="event.html?id=archive-bigbus-mar-2025">
      <div class="ae-cover"><img src="assets/covers/bus.svg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div>
        <div class="archive-meta-row">
          <span class="type">Workshop</span>
          <span>22 March 2025</span>
          <span>Workshop</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="ae-title">The Big Bus — Building Workshop</h3>
        <div class="ae-title-ar ar" dir="rtl">ورشة الحافلة الكبيرة</div>
        <p class="ae-writeup en-only">We tried to convert a 1986 Mercedes coach into a mobile cinema, and mostly succeeded. Three benches, one projector mount, two broken drill bits. The bus is now parked behind the Cabinet, ready for its first screening tour through the West Bank.</p>
        <p class="ae-writeup-ar ar-only ar" dir="rtl">حاولنا تحويل حافلة مرسيدس موديل ١٩٨٦ إلى سينما متنقلة. ثلاثة مقاعد، حامل بروجكتور، ولقمتي ثقب مكسورتين.</p>
        <span class="ae-readmore">
          <span class="en-only">Read full account</span>
          <span class="ar-only ar" dir="rtl">القراءة كاملةً</span>
          <span class="ae-readmore-arrow">→</span>
        </span>
      </div>
    </a>
  
    <a class="archive-entry" href="event.html?id=archive-opening-oct-2024">
      <div class="ae-cover"><img src="assets/covers/opening.svg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div>
        <div class="archive-meta-row">
          <span class="type">Opening</span>
          <span>12 October 2024</span>
          <span>Whole building</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="ae-title">Cabinet Opening Night</h3>
        <div class="ae-title-ar ar" dir="rtl">ليلة افتتاح المجلس</div>
        <p class="ae-writeup en-only">Two hundred people walked through the doors on the night the Cabinet first opened — neighbours, makers, students, friends from Bethlehem, Ramallah, Jerusalem, Haifa. Tea kept appearing. Three hours in, the courtyard had turned into a small dance floor. Notes from that night still hang on the corkboard upstairs.</p>
        <p class="ae-writeup-ar ar-only ar" dir="rtl">في ليلة افتتاح المجلس، عبرت أبوابه نحو مئتين من الأصدقاء والجيران والصنّاع. الشاي لا ينتهي، والساحة تحوّلت بعد ثلاث ساعات إلى حلبة رقص صغيرة.</p>
        <span class="ae-readmore">
          <span class="en-only">Read full account</span>
          <span class="ar-only ar" dir="rtl">القراءة كاملةً</span>
          <span class="ae-readmore-arrow">→</span>
        </span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

